{"id":"c72edfd3-6513-4279-a5ff-287dc1a70996","createdAt":"2026-10-26T15:24:50.916Z","batchId":"settings_claude-sonnet-5-5_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-sonnet-5-5","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <div class=\"stack\">\n    <h1>Account settings</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, choose how you hear from us, and control who can see your information.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row gap-sm\" role=\"tablist\" id=\"tabs\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" data-tab=\"profile\">Profile</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\" data-tab=\"notifications\">Notifications</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\" data-tab=\"privacy\">Privacy</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <section id=\"profile\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-panel>\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Profile</div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">This information appears on your public page and in shared workspaces.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-lg center\">\n        <div class=\"avatar\">MR</div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Upload photo</button>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Remove</button>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">PNG or JPG, at least 256×256px, up to 2 MB.</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <label>First name<input type=\"text\" value=\"Maya\"></label>\n        <label>Last name<input type=\"text\" value=\"Rodriguez\"></label>\n        <label>Email address<input type=\"email\" value=\"maya.rodriguez@northwind.io\"></label>\n        <label>Phone<input type=\"tel\" value=\"+1 (415) 555-0172\"></label>\n        <label>Job title<input type=\"text\" value=\"Product Operations Lead\"></label>\n        <label>Time zone\n          <select>\n            <option>Pacific Time (UTC−08:00)</option>\n            <option>Mountain Time (UTC−07:00)</option>\n            <option>Eastern Time (UTC−05:00)</option>\n            <option>Central European Time (UTC+01:00)</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <label>Bio<textarea rows=\"3\">Helping teams ship calmer, clearer launches. Based in San Francisco.</textarea></label>\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Email changes require confirmation from your new address.</span>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn\">Save profile</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Discard changes</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"notifications\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-panel hidden>\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Notifications</div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Pick the channels for each type of update. Security alerts are always sent by email.</p>\n      </div>\n      <table class=\"table\">\n        <thead><tr><th>Activity</th><th>Email</th><th>Push</th><th>SMS</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td><strong>Comments and mentions</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">When someone replies or tags you</span></td>\n            <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> </label></td><td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> </label></td><td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> </label></td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Project updates</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Status changes and deadline reminders</span></td>\n            <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> </label></td><td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> </label></td><td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> </label></td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Billing and invoices</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Receipts, failed payments, plan changes</span></td>\n            <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> </label></td><td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> </label></td><td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> </label></td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Security alerts</strong> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Required</span><br><span class=\"small muted\">New sign-ins and password changes</span></td>\n            <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> </label></td><td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> </label></td><td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> </label></td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <label>Weekly digest\n          <select><option>Mondays, 9:00 AM</option><option>Fridays, 4:00 PM</option><option>Off</option></select>\n        </label>\n        <label>Quiet hours\n          <select><option>10:00 PM – 7:00 AM</option><option>8:00 PM – 8:00 AM</option><option>Off</option></select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Product news and feature announcements</label>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn\">Save preferences</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Mute everything for 24 hours</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"privacy\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-panel hidden>\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Privacy</div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Decide what other people can see and how your data is used.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <label>Profile visibility\n          <select><option>Anyone in my workspace</option><option>Only people I collaborate with</option><option>Only me</option></select>\n        </label>\n        <label>Who can message me\n          <select><option>Workspace members</option><option>Collaborators only</option><option>No one</option></select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Show my email address on my profile</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Show my online status</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Share anonymous usage data to help improve the product</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Allow personalised recommendations based on my activity</label>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><button class=\"btn\">Save privacy settings</button></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <div class=\"row between center\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"card-title\">Your data</div>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Download a copy of your content or review active sessions.</p>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Last export: never</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Request data export</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Sign out of other devices</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Danger zone</div>\n      <div class=\"alert alert-destructive\">Deleting your account permanently removes your profile, projects and comments after a 14-day grace period. This cannot be undone.</div>\n      <div><button class=\"btn btn-destructive\">Delete account</button></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var tabs=document.querySelectorAll('#tabs [data-tab]');\n  var panels=document.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]');\n  tabs.forEach(function(t){\n    t.addEventListener('click',function(){\n      tabs.forEach(function(x){x.classList.toggle('btn-ghost',x!==t);});\n      panels.forEach(function(p){p.hidden=p.id!==t.dataset.tab;});\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[628,"<div class=\"page st"],[895,"ack gap-lg\">"],[901,"\n  <div class=\"stack\">"],[901,"\n    <h1>Account"],[901," settings</h1>\n    "],[901,"<p class=\"lead\">"],[901,"Manage your profile, cho"],[901,"ose how you h"],[915,"ear from"],[951," us, and control who can see your"],[988," information.</p>\n  "],[1024,"</div>\n\n  <div"],[1057," class=\"row g"],[1188,"ap-sm\" role"],[1188,"=\"tablist\" id"],[1188,"=\"t"],[1201,"abs\">\n    <button class"],[1234,"=\"btn btn-s"],[1272,"m\" data-tab=\"prof"],[1308,"ile\">Profile</button>"],[1343,"\n    <button class=\"btn"],[1379," btn-sm btn-"],[1419,"ghost\" data-tab"],[1450,"=\"notifications\">Notif"],[1488,"ications</button>\n    <button"],[1525," class=\"btn btn-s"],[1559,"m btn-ghost\""],[1596," data-tab=\"privacy"],[1630,"\">Privacy</button>"],[1667,"\n  </div>\n\n  <"],[1704,"section id=\"profile\" class=\""],[1738,"stack g"],[1773,"ap-lg\" data-pan"],[1818,"el>\n    <div class=\""],[1847,"card st"],[1881,"ack\">"],[1916,"\n      <div>"],[1954,"\n        <div class=\"card-"],[1987,"title\">Profile</div>"],[2022,"\n        <p"],[2059," class=\"card-desc\">This"],[2107," information appears on your public page"],[2130," and"],[2164," in sh"],[2199,"ared work"],[2236,"spaces.</p>"],[2271,"\n      </div>\n      <div"],[2305," class=\"row g"],[2341,"ap-lg center"],[2380,"\">\n        <div class=\"av"],[2414,"atar\">"],[2454,"MR</div>\n        <"],[2492,"div class=\"stack g"]